graph TD
  accTitle: Human approval. Traceable receipt stages.
  accDescr: Implemented local protocol / fixture transitions. Receipts are supplied facts, not movement proof. Solid arrows: implemented LOCAL / FIXTURE paths. Dashed arrows: missing / dormant / concept. Local frontend movement and backend receipt protocol remain separate verified slices. Exercise prototype. Simulated feeds. Prototype forecasts. No operational emergency-response use. 2026-11-15 / source c98415b snapshot. Not a fresh provider or deployment receipt.
  PROPOSAL["1  Proposal<br/>Finite scope"]
  APPROVAL["2  Current human Chief approval<br/>Human authority / current request"]
  COMMAND["3  Reservation + enqueued command<br/>Immutable local command"]
  STOP["No executable command<br/>Rejection / stale / wrong authority"]
  DELIVERED["4  Delivered receipt<br/>Supplied fact"]
  ACCEPTED["5  Accepted receipt<br/>Supplied fact"]
  COMPLETED["6  Completed receipt<br/>Supplied fact"]
  REPLAY["7  Received-cutoff replay<br/>Received local protocol facts<br/>Not proof a frontend executor performed work"]
  EXECUTOR["Frontend execution<br/>NOT CONNECTED<br/>Command mapping pending"]
  LOSS["Producer loss: frozen<br/>No automatic takeover"]
  PROPOSAL -- "LOCAL / FIXTURE" --> APPROVAL
  APPROVAL -- "LOCAL / FIXTURE" --> COMMAND
  APPROVAL -- "LOCAL / FIXTURE" --> STOP
  COMMAND -- "LOCAL / FIXTURE" --> DELIVERED
  DELIVERED -- "LOCAL / FIXTURE" --> ACCEPTED
  ACCEPTED -- "LOCAL / FIXTURE" --> COMPLETED
  COMPLETED -- "LOCAL / FIXTURE" --> REPLAY
  COMMAND -. "NOT CONNECTED / mapping pending" .-> EXECUTOR
  LEGEND["Solid arrows: implemented LOCAL / FIXTURE paths. Dashed arrows: missing / dormant / concept."]
  BOUNDARY["Local frontend movement and backend receipt protocol remain separate verified slices.<br/>Exercise prototype. Simulated feeds. Prototype forecasts. No operational emergency-response use.<br/>2026-11-15 / source c98415b snapshot. Not a fresh provider or deployment receipt."]
